      "source": "This interface uses <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a> for the id type, allowing you to annotate entity fields or properties with\n<a href=\"../core/mapping/PrimaryKeyColumn.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>@PrimaryKeyColumn</code></a>. Use this interface if you do not require a composite primary key class\nand want to specify the Id with <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a>.",
      "translation": "该接口使用<a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a>作为 ID 类型，允许您使用<a href=\"../core/mapping/PrimaryKeyColumn.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>@PrimaryKeyColumn</code></a>注解实体字段或属性。如果您不需要复合主键类，并希望使用<a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a>指定 ID，请使用此接口。",
      "count": 1
