      "source": "Spring Data for Apache Cassandra Core",
      "translation": "Apache Cassandra Spring Data 核心",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<li>Define your entity, including a field or property for each column, including those for partition and (optional)\ncluster columns.</li>\n<li>Annotate each partition &amp; cluster field or property with <a href=\"../core/mapping/PrimaryKeyColumn.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>@PrimaryKeyColumn</code></a></li>\n<li>Define your repository interface to be a subinterface of this interface, which uses a provided id type,\n<a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a> (implemented by <a href=\"../core/mapping/BasicMapId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMapId</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Whenever you need a <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a>, you can use the static factory method <a href=\"../core/mapping/BasicMapId.html#id()\"><code>BasicMapId.id()</code></a> (which is\nconvenient if you import statically) and the builder method <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html#with(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>MapId.with(String, Object)</code></a> to easily construct an\nid.</li>\n<li>Optionally, entity class authors can have their entities implement <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapIdentifiable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapIdentifiable</code></a>, to make it easier and\nquicker for entity clients to get the entity's identity.</li>",
      "translation": "<li>定义您的实体，包括每个列对应的字段或属性，其中包含用于分区和（可选）聚簇列的字段。</li>\n<li>为每个分区和聚簇字段或属性添加 <a href=\"../core/mapping/PrimaryKeyColumn.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>@PrimaryKeyColumn</code></a> 注解。</li>\n<li>定义您的存储库接口作为该接口的子接口，并使用提供的 id 类型 <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MapId</code></a>（由 <a href=\"../core/mapping/BasicMapId.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>BasicMapId</code></a> 实现）。</li>\n<li>每当需要 <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MapId</code></a> 时，可以使用静态工厂方法 <a href=\"../core/mapping/BasicMapId.html#id()\"><code>BasicMapId.id()</code></a>（如果进行了静态导入则非常方便）以及构建器方法 <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html#with(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>MapId.with(String, Object)</code></a> 来轻松构造 id。</li>\n<li>可选地，实体类作者可以让其实体实现 <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapIdentifiable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MapIdentifiable</code></a>，以便让实体客户端更容易、更快速地获取实体的标识。</li>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>\n<dt>Author:</dt>\n<dd>Matthew T. Adams, Mark Paluch</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"CassandraRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository\"><code>CassandraRepository</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../core/mapping/MapIdentifiable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapIdentifiable</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>版本:</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>\n<dt>作者:</dt>\n<dd>Matthew T. Adams, Mark Paluch</dd>\n<dt>参见:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"CassandraRepository.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository 中的接口\"><code>CassandraRepository</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MapId</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../core/mapping/MapIdentifiable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MapIdentifiable</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
